name>Young</surname> <given-names>NS</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Parvovirus B19 infection and bone marrow transplantation.</article-title><source>Ann Hematol</source> <year>1992</year>;<volume>64</volume>:<fpage>A121</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>4</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF01715363</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1637889</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R8"><label>8. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Gallinella</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Manaresi</surname> <given-names>E</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Venturoli</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Grazi</surname> <given-names>GL</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Musiani</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Zerbini</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Occurrence and clinical role of active parvovirus B19 infections in transplant recipients.</article-title><source>Eur J Clin Microbiol Infect Dis</source> <year>1999</year>;<volume>18</volume>:<fpage>811</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>3</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s100960050406</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10614957</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R9"><label>9. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Zolnourian</surname> <given-names>ZR</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Curran</surname> <given-names>MD</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Rima</surname> <given-names>BK</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Coyle</surname> <given-names>PV</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>O&#x02019;Neill</surname> <given-names>HJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Middleton</surname> <given-names>D</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Parvovirus B19 in kidney transplant patients.</article-title><source>Transplantation</source> <year>2000</year>;<volume>69</volume>:<fpage>2198</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>202</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007890-200005270-00043</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10852625</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>